# Alice Hotel — Frontend

Vue 3 + Vite + TS + Pinia + Vuetify. Apps: `alice.hotel.fe.admin`, `alice.hotel.fe.client`.

## Feature module shape

```
src/stores/{feature}/
  index.ts              # defineStore("{feature}Store", () => { ... })
  {feature}.service.ts  # URL path constants
  {feature}.type.ts
```

- HTTP: only via `src/utils/http.ts` (Axios, `VITE_API_ENDPOINT`, `withCredentials: true`)
- Business data: `response.data.data`
- Routes/names: `router/screen.ts`; auth: `middleware/auth.ts`
- Components: PascalCase `.vue`; i18n under `locales/{vi,en,ko}/`

## Style / PR

- Match existing Prettier: double quotes, `printWidth: 150`, `trailingComma: "all"`
- Before PR in the touched app: `npm run lint`, `npm run format`
- Env: copy from `.env.example`; never commit real secrets

See [STANDARDS.md](../../STANDARDS.md) §3 and §4.
